      "originalText": "F1: เข้าสู่ระบบ MFU SSO & หน้าแรกแบบสอบถามผู้ตอบ (/pages/login, /forms)",
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
    {
      "id": "card_f1_b",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 2622,
      "width": 2580,
      "height": 73,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
