      "type": "text",
      "text": "F4: การตอบแบบสอบถาม (Form Fill) & การตรวจดูคำตอบรายบุคคล (/forms/:id, /response/:id)",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 24,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "F4: การตอบแบบสอบถาม (Form Fill) & การตรวจดูคำตอบรายบุคคล (/forms/:id, /response/:id)",
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
    {
      "id": "card_f4_b",
      "x": 2834,
      "y": 3512,
      "width": 2740,
      "height": 98,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
